#: scripts/README.md:1
msgid "Python scripts for pre- and post-processing of EMMIVox simulations"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:3
msgid ""
"Here you will find some python scripts useful to setup and analyze EMMIVox "
"simulations. For info about their syntax, just type:"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:5
msgid "`python script.py -h`"
msgstr "`python script.py -h`"

#: scripts/README.md:7
msgid "Brief overview:"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:8
msgid ""
"`align-VOXELS.py`: align two PDBs based on an atom selections, dump the "
"transformation to file, apply transformation to a cryo-EM map, write "
"transformed cryo-EM map to file;"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:9
msgid ""
"`align-PDBs.py`: transform one PDB based on the inverse transformation read "
"from file;"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:10
msgid ""
"`align-XTC.py`: transform a trajectory in XTC format based on the inverse "
"transformation read from file;"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:11
msgid ""
"`cryo-EM_preprocess.py`: filter correlated voxels of a cryo-EM map, "
"calculate error map from two half maps, zone the map close to the input "
"model, write filtered map in PLUMED format to file;"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:12
msgid ""
"`cryo-EM_validate.py`: calculate model/map fit (CCmask like) from one PDB, "
"two PDBs, or two PDBs and a trajectory (average map);"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:13
msgid ""
"`add-BFACT.py`: read a PDB file and a EMMIStatus file (with Bfactor) and "
"create a new PDB file with Bfactor column;"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:14
msgid ""
"`make_ndx.py` and `make_XTC_ndx.py`: create GROMACS index files with "
"selection of atoms."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:16
msgid "**Software installation**"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/README.md:18
msgid ""
"You can create a conda environment to install all the python libraries "
"needed to run pre- and post-processing tools."
msgstr "conda 環境を作成し、前処理・後処理ツールの実行に必要な Python ライブラリをすべてインストールできる。"

#: scripts/README.md:20
msgid "`conda create --name emmivox`"
msgstr "`conda create --name emmivox`"

#: scripts/README.md:22
msgid "`conda activate emmivox`"
msgstr "`conda activate emmivox`"

#: scripts/README.md:24
msgid "`conda install -c conda-forge mrcfile mdanalysis biopython`"
msgstr "`conda install -c conda-forge mrcfile mdanalysis biopython`"

#: scripts/README.md:26
msgid "Make sure you are installing MDAnalysis version >= 2.0.0."
msgstr "MDAnalysis 2.0.0 以上をインストールしていることを確認する。"

#: scripts/README.md:28
msgid ""
"In this environment, you also need to install `pytorch` using the "
"instructions available [here](https://pytorch.org). Make sure you select a "
"version compatible with the Cuda version installed on your machine or "
"alternatively the CPU version. These instructions are for pytorch version "
"1.13.0 with Cuda 11.6:"
msgstr ""
"この環境には、[こちら](https://pytorch.org)の手順に従って `pytorch` もインストールする必要がある。マシン上の CUDA"
" のバージョンに対応するもの、または CPU 版を選ぶ。以下は CUDA 11.6 を使用する PyTorch 1.13.0 の手順である。"

#: scripts/README.md:32
msgid ""
"`conda install pytorch torchvision torchaudio pytorch-cuda=11.6 -c pytorch "
"-c nvidia`"
msgstr ""
"`conda install pytorch torchvision torchaudio pytorch-cuda=11.6 -c pytorch "
"-c nvidia`"
